Map:EreborHighlands/Desc
"The Highlands of Erebor, formerly known as the Desolation of Smaug, have seen much resettlement in the years since Dain Ironfoot ascendance. Rich in metal and minerals, it has once again become the heartland of the kingdom of Durin's Folk. \nCapturables: Inns \nCreeps: Wargs \nRegion: Rhovanion"
End
